    Beispiel  :

¢!
»['echo'|"Hallo"|{’Wait-s’|¨3¨}]«

ø,CSS,|
    misc {
  swallow_regex = ^(kitty)$
  term = kitty
  open = kitty
    }ø
    = §kitty þ1623512 # þ Optional
!¢

